    user_response: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 overflow-hidden font-sans\\\">\\n  <!-- TOP NAVIGATION & CONTROLS -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-6 flex items-center justify-between shrink-0 shadow-sm\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-indigo-600 p-2 rounded text-white font-bold\\\">DP</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold leading-tight uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800\\\">Place Profiles</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">IB Geography Case-Study Analysis</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 max-w-xl mx-12 flex items-center space-x-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-40\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 block mb-1\\\">Case Study Entity</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"border border-slate-300 rounded px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold\\\">Vietnam</span>\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\\\"></path></svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between mb-1\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400\\\">Temporal Horizon</label>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-indigo-600\\\">Year: 2024</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"relative h-6 flex items-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute w-full h-1 bg-slate-200 rounded\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute w-[75%] h-1 bg-indigo-500 rounded\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute left-[75%] w-4 h-4 bg-white border-2 border-indigo-600 rounded-full shadow-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between w-full mt-6 text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-400\\\">\\n            <span>1970</span><span>1990</span><span>2010</span><span class=\\\"text-indigo-600\\\">2024</span><span>2040</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"flex space-x-2\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded shadow-sm\\\">EXPORT DATA</button>\\n      <button class=\\\"p-2 border border-slate-300 rounded\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z\\\"></path></svg></button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- TAB BAR -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-12 bg-slate-100 border-b border-slate-200 px-6 flex items-center space-x-8 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Population Dynamics</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Globalisation</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Economy</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Physical Layer</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Political Economy</button>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex p-4 gap-4 bg-slate-50\\\">\\n    \\n    <!-- LEFT SIDEBAR: Index & Sectors -->\\n    <div class=\\\"w-1/4 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n      <!-- Globalisation Card -->\\n      <section class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase text-slate-400 tracking-tighter\\\">KOF Index Dimensions</h2>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 rounded-full font-bold\\\">2024 Rank: 68</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase\\\"><span>Economic</span><span class=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">64 / 100</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-slate-100 rounded-full flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[40%] bg-indigo-600\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[24%] bg-indigo-300 border-l border-white\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[8px] mt-1 text-slate-400\\\"><span>De Facto</span><span>De Jure</span></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase\\\"><span>Social</span><span class=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">51 / 100</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-slate-100 rounded-full flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[30%] bg-indigo-600\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[21%] bg-indigo-300 border-l border-white\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase\\\"><span>Political</span><span class=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">78 / 100</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-slate-100 rounded-full flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[45%] bg-indigo-600\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[33%] bg-indigo-300 border-l border-white\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- Economy / Sector Profile Card -->\\n      <section class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-3\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase text-slate-400 tracking-tighter\\\">Sectoral Employment</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-3 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full relative\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute right-0.5 top-0.5 w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Merge S/K</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex h-32 w-full gap-1 items-end\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-amber-500 rounded-t-sm relative group\\\" style=\\\"height: 42%\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">42%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-blue-900 rounded-t-sm relative\\\" style=\\\"height: 25%\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">25%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-blue-600 rounded-t-sm relative\\\" style=\\\"height: 30%\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">30%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-blue-300 rounded-t-sm relative\\\" style=\\\"height: 3%\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">3%</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1 mt-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[7px] font-bold text-center uppercase\\\">Primary</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[7px] font-bold text-center uppercase\\\">Second.</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[7px] font-bold text-center uppercase\\\">Tertiary</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[7px] font-bold text-center uppercase\\\">Quatern.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- CENTER ENGINE: Population Dynamics -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <!-- Population Pyramid -->\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/2 p-4 border-r border-slate-100 flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Demographic Transition Model (Stage 3)</h3>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\\\">Cohorts in %</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col-reverse justify-between pr-2 border-r border-slate-200\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[20%] bg-indigo-100 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[40%] bg-indigo-200 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[65%] bg-indigo-300 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[80%] bg-indigo-400 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[85%] bg-indigo-500 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[88%] bg-indigo-600 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[92%] bg-indigo-700 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[95%] bg-indigo-800 self-end text-[8px] text-white flex items-center pr-1\\\">MALE</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col-reverse justify-between pl-2\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[22%] bg-rose-100\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[42%] bg-rose-200\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[68%] bg-rose-300\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[82%] bg-rose-400\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[84%] bg-rose-500\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[86%] bg-rose-600\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[91%] bg-rose-700\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[96%] bg-rose-800 text-[8px] text-white flex items-center pl-1\\\">FEMALE</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-50\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed italic\\\">\\n              Synoptic Note: Rapidly shrinking base suggests falling fertility rates (Doi Moi legacy) while a bulge in the 25-39 cohort drives current industrial output.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Density Choropleth -->\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/2 p-4 bg-slate-50 relative flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\\\">Sub-National Admin-1 Density</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center relative\\\">\\n            <!-- Mock Map Shape -->\\n            <div class=\\\"w-40 h-64 bg-slate-200 rounded-[50%_40%_60%_30%] relative border-2 border-white overflow-hidden shadow-inner\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-full h-1/4 bg-red-600 opacity-60\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-1/4 bg-red-700 opacity-80\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-full bg-red-200 rotate-12\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <!-- Legend -->\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-white p-2 border border-slate-200 rounded text-[8px] flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-800\\\"></div><span>&gt; 1000 p/km\302\262</span></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500\\\"></div><span>500 - 999</span></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-200\\\"></div><span>&lt; 500</span></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <!-- Political Economy Ledger -->\\n      <div class=\\\"h-32 bg-slate-800 text-white border border-slate-700 rounded-lg shadow-lg p-4\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400 mb-2\\\">Political Economy Ledger</h2>\\n        <table class=\\\"w-full text-[10px]\\\">\\n          <thead>\\n            <tr class=\\\"text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-700\\\">\\n              <th class=\\\"text-left pb-1\\\">Metric</th>\\n              <th class=\\\"text-right pb-1\\\">Score / Classification</th>\\n              <th class=\\\"text-right pb-1\\\">Year-on-Year Trend</th>\\n            </tr>\\n          </thead>\\n          <tbody class=\\\"text-slate-200\\\">\\n            <tr class=\\\"border-b border-slate-700/50\\\">\\n              <td class=\\\"py-1.5\\\">Informal Economy (% of GDP)</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right\\\">18.4%</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right text-emerald-400\\\">\342\206\223 1.2% (Consolidating)</td>\\n            </tr>\\n            <tr class=\\\"border-b border-slate-700/50\\\">\\n              <td class=\\\"py-1.5\\\">EIU Governance Status</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right font-mono\\\">Authoritarian Regime</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right text-slate-400\\\">Stable</td>\\n            </tr>\\n            <tr>\\n              <td class=\\\"py-1.5\\\">Transparency Int. CPI</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right\\\">42/100</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right text-emerald-400\\\">+3 Points (Improving)</td>\\n            </tr>\\n          </tbody>\\n        </table>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- RIGHT SIDEBAR: Physical Layer -->\\n    <div class=\\\"w-1/4 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm flex-1 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase text-slate-400 tracking-tighter mb-4\\\">\'Prisoners of Geography\' Analysis</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4 overflow-y-auto pr-1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-3\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-800\\\">Hydrological Arteries</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              The Mekong Delta serves as a core agricultural hub but creates regional water dependency on upstream damming in Yunnan.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-3\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-800\\\">Topographic Friction</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Annamite Cordillera acts as a physical barrier to West-East integration, focusing development along the coastal littoral corridor.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-l-2 border-amber-500 pl-3\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-800\\\">Choke Points</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Proximal to the South China Sea SLOCs; geopolitical vulnerability due to the Nine-Dash Line maritime territorial disputes.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-700 block mb-1\\\">A.T. Kearney Index</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-xl font-black text-indigo-900\\\">#55</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[9px] text-indigo-500 mb-1 font-medium\\\">Global Cities Ranking</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- FOOTER STATUS -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-8 bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 px-6 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex space-x-6\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"flex items-center\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full mr-2\\\"></div>Live System Status</span>\\n      <span>DB: CaseStudy_VN_2024.json</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"uppercase tracking-tighter font-medium\\\">\\n      Principal Engineer Workspace \342\200\242 Interactive Simulation v2.4.1\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 overflow-hidden font-sans\\\">\\n  <!-- TOP NAVIGATION & CONTROLS -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-6 flex items-center justify-between shrink-0 shadow-sm\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-indigo-600 p-2 rounded text-white font-bold\\\">DP</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold leading-tight uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800\\\">Place Profiles</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">IB Geography Case-Study Analysis</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 max-w-xl mx-12 flex items-center space-x-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-40\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 block mb-1\\\">Case Study Entity</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"border border-slate-300 rounded px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold\\\">Vietnam</span>\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\\\"></path></svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between mb-1\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400\\\">Temporal Horizon</label>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-indigo-600\\\">Year: 2024</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"relative h-6 flex items-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute w-full h-1 bg-slate-200 rounded\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute w-[75%] h-1 bg-indigo-500 rounded\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute left-[75%] w-4 h-4 bg-white border-2 border-indigo-600 rounded-full shadow-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between w-full mt-6 text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-400\\\">\\n            <span>1970</span><span>1990</span><span>2010</span><span class=\\\"text-indigo-600\\\">2024</span><span>2040</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"flex space-x-2\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded shadow-sm\\\">EXPORT DATA</button>\\n      <button class=\\\"p-2 border border-slate-300 rounded\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z\\\"></path></svg></button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- TAB BAR -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-12 bg-slate-100 border-b border-slate-200 px-6 flex items-center space-x-8 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Population Dynamics</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Globalisation</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Economy</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Physical Layer</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Political Economy</button>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex p-4 gap-4 bg-slate-50\\\">\\n    \\n    <!-- LEFT SIDEBAR: Index & Sectors -->\\n    <div class=\\\"w-1/4 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n      <!-- Globalisation Card -->\\n      <section class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase text-slate-400 tracking-tighter\\\">KOF Index Dimensions</h2>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 rounded-full font-bold\\\">2024 Rank: 68</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase\\\"><span>Economic</span><span class=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">64 / 100</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-slate-100 rounded-full flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[40%] bg-indigo-600\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[24%] bg-indigo-300 border-l border-white\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[8px] mt-1 text-slate-400\\\"><span>De Facto</span><span>De Jure</span></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase\\\"><span>Social</span><span class=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">51 / 100</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-slate-100 rounded-full flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[30%] bg-indigo-600\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[21%] bg-indigo-300 border-l border-white\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase\\\"><span>Political</span><span class=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">78 / 100</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-2 bg-slate-100 rounded-full flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[45%] bg-indigo-600\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-[33%] bg-indigo-300 border-l border-white\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- Economy / Sector Profile Card -->\\n      <section class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-3\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase text-slate-400 tracking-tighter\\\">Sectoral Employment</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1 cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-3 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full relative\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute right-0.5 top-0.5 w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Merge S/K</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex h-32 w-full gap-1 items-end\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-amber-500 rounded-t-sm relative group\\\" style=\\\"height: 42%\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">42%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-blue-900 rounded-t-sm relative\\\" style=\\\"height: 25%\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">25%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-blue-600 rounded-t-sm relative\\\" style=\\\"height: 30%\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">30%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-blue-300 rounded-t-sm relative\\\" style=\\\"height: 3%\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">3%</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1 mt-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[7px] font-bold text-center uppercase\\\">Primary</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[7px] font-bold text-center uppercase\\\">Second.</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[7px] font-bold text-center uppercase\\\">Tertiary</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[7px] font-bold text-center uppercase\\\">Quatern.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- CENTER ENGINE: Population Dynamics -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <!-- Population Pyramid -->\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/2 p-4 border-r border-slate-100 flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Demographic Transition Model (Stage 3)</h3>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\\\">Cohorts in %</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col-reverse justify-between pr-2 border-r border-slate-200\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[20%] bg-indigo-100 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[40%] bg-indigo-200 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[65%] bg-indigo-300 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[80%] bg-indigo-400 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[85%] bg-indigo-500 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[88%] bg-indigo-600 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[92%] bg-indigo-700 self-end\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[95%] bg-indigo-800 self-end text-[8px] text-white flex items-center pr-1\\\">MALE</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col-reverse justify-between pl-2\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[22%] bg-rose-100\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[42%] bg-rose-200\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[68%] bg-rose-300\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[82%] bg-rose-400\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[84%] bg-rose-500\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[86%] bg-rose-600\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[91%] bg-rose-700\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-3 w-[96%] bg-rose-800 text-[8px] text-white flex items-center pl-1\\\">FEMALE</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-50\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed italic\\\">\\n              Synoptic Note: Rapidly shrinking base suggests falling fertility rates (Doi Moi legacy) while a bulge in the 25-39 cohort drives current industrial output.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Density Choropleth -->\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/2 p-4 bg-slate-50 relative flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\\\">Sub-National Admin-1 Density</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center relative\\\">\\n            <!-- Mock Map Shape -->\\n            <div class=\\\"w-40 h-64 bg-slate-200 rounded-[50%_40%_60%_30%] relative border-2 border-white overflow-hidden shadow-inner\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-full h-1/4 bg-red-600 opacity-60\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-1/4 bg-red-700 opacity-80\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-full bg-red-200 rotate-12\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <!-- Legend -->\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-white p-2 border border-slate-200 rounded text-[8px] flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-800\\\"></div><span>&gt; 1000 p/km\302\262</span></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500\\\"></div><span>500 - 999</span></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-200\\\"></div><span>&lt; 500</span></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <!-- Political Economy Ledger -->\\n      <div class=\\\"h-32 bg-slate-800 text-white border border-slate-700 rounded-lg shadow-lg p-4\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400 mb-2\\\">Political Economy Ledger</h2>\\n        <table class=\\\"w-full text-[10px]\\\">\\n          <thead>\\n            <tr class=\\\"text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-700\\\">\\n              <th class=\\\"text-left pb-1\\\">Metric</th>\\n              <th class=\\\"text-right pb-1\\\">Score / Classification</th>\\n              <th class=\\\"text-right pb-1\\\">Year-on-Year Trend</th>\\n            </tr>\\n          </thead>\\n          <tbody class=\\\"text-slate-200\\\">\\n            <tr class=\\\"border-b border-slate-700/50\\\">\\n              <td class=\\\"py-1.5\\\">Informal Economy (% of GDP)</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right\\\">18.4%</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right text-emerald-400\\\">\342\206\223 1.2% (Consolidating)</td>\\n            </tr>\\n            <tr class=\\\"border-b border-slate-700/50\\\">\\n              <td class=\\\"py-1.5\\\">EIU Governance Status</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right font-mono\\\">Authoritarian Regime</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right text-slate-400\\\">Stable</td>\\n            </tr>\\n            <tr>\\n              <td class=\\\"py-1.5\\\">Transparency Int. CPI</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right\\\">42/100</td>\\n              <td class=\\\"text-right text-emerald-400\\\">+3 Points (Improving)</td>\\n            </tr>\\n          </tbody>\\n        </table>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- RIGHT SIDEBAR: Physical Layer -->\\n    <div class=\\\"w-1/4 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm flex-1 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase text-slate-400 tracking-tighter mb-4\\\">\'Prisoners of Geography\' Analysis</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4 overflow-y-auto pr-1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-3\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-800\\\">Hydrological Arteries</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              The Mekong Delta serves as a core agricultural hub but creates regional water dependency on upstream damming in Yunnan.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-3\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-800\\\">Topographic Friction</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Annamite Cordillera acts as a physical barrier to West-East integration, focusing development along the coastal littoral corridor.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-l-2 border-amber-500 pl-3\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-800\\\">Choke Points</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Proximal to the South China Sea SLOCs; geopolitical vulnerability due to the Nine-Dash Line maritime territorial disputes.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-700 block mb-1\\\">A.T. Kearney Index</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-xl font-black text-indigo-900\\\">#55</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[9px] text-indigo-500 mb-1 font-medium\\\">Global Cities Ranking</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- FOOTER STATUS -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-8 bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 px-6 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex space-x-6\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"flex items-center\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full mr-2\\\"></div>Live System Status</span>\\n      <span>DB: CaseStudy_VN_2024.json</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"uppercase tracking-tighter font-medium\\\">\\n      Principal Engineer Workspace \342\200\242 Interactive Simulation v2.4.1\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
